    "body": "Fixes #36334\r\n\r\nThe \"CreateNewBlock(): block weight: ...\" line was logged unconditionally and could not be turned off, filling the debug log when block templates are built frequently.\r\n\r\nMove it behind a new \"mining\" logging category, enabled with -debug=mining.\r\n",
